OL,3,GNEWSATikTok and Instagram don't prepare
OL,4,Ahikers for dangers, rescuers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FLlanberis Mountain Rescue Team (LMRT),
OL,7,Fbased in Eryri, also known as
OL,8,FSnowdonia, said the pressure on
OL,9,Fvolunteers was "unsustainable", a
OL,10,Fconcern echoed by mountain rescuers in
OL,11,Fthe Brecon Beacons who say demand
OL,12,F"keeps rising".
